{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50612","headline":"题灵泉寺 · 徐淮","name":"题灵泉寺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"梵宇栖真所，寥寥世事稀。\n老僧[披]（被）百纳，童子学三归。\n宝刹临香地，星宫隐翠微。\n谁怜漂泊者，於此遂忘机。\n（亦见《安阳县金石录》。\n）（按此诗与徐源诗刻一石，诗下原题「东海徐淮字黄河」七字。\n〖1〗徐淮，原作「徐涵」，从《文物》一九八六年第三期灵泉寺石刻拓片改。\n四诗亦据改数字。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐淮","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50612.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50612","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}